{"title":"뉴비가 너무 강함","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=hz75Z/hzXapOrZhd/oKf8uHhzoez8KB1K0CdTQ1&filename=th3","synopsis":"부모님 없이 보육원에서 자란 재주\n이름처럼 재주있게 살아가던 어느날\n보육원이 어려워 3년 뒤 문을 닫게 된다는 이야기를 듣게 된다.\n\n보육원을 위해 돈을 구해보려던 재주의 핸드폰에\n갑작스럽게 알림이 울리고\n핸드폰에서는 탑을 오르며 BJ가 되어있는 \n자신의 영상이 재생된다.\n\n7년 전, 갑작스럽게 세상에 나타나\n무작위로 사람을 데려가는 탑.\n\n이 탑에서 무사히 돌아와 '각성자' 가 된다면\n큰 돈을 버는 것은 시간 문제!\n\n핸드폰에 영상을 보낸 것은 누구이며\n재주는 무사히 탑을 오를 수 있을 것인가?!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":188,"change":{"type":"down","amount":16}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":132,"change":{"type":"up","amount":56}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":137,"change":{"type":"down","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":148,"change":{"type":"down","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":155,"change":{"type":"down","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":149,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":186,"change":{"type":"down","amount":37}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":144,"change":{"type":"up","amount":42}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":146,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":177,"change":{"type":"down","amount":31}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":183,"change":{"type":"down","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":119,"change":{"type":"up","amount":64}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":157,"change":{"type":"down","amount":38}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":158,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":154,"change":{"type":"up","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":127,"change":{"type":"up","amount":27}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":147,"change":{"type":"down","amount":20}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":147,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":164,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":144,"change":{"type":"up","amount":20}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":128,"change":{"type":"up","amount":16}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":125,"change":{"type":"up","amount"